# L §7.6 item 1 (tally 2.1.6, issue #89): the twin of L7_6_move_day_seen dated end_of(y) - 1 day, 9999-12-31,
# loads and books the fee in 9999. tally 2.1.5's refcore refused the model REFCORE-NOT-YET.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 9999-12-31
  start 9999-01-01
  end 9999-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place other: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place landlord: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN

move fee[y in years]: transfers
  on end_of(y) - 1 day
  leg cash from konto to landlord amount amt

version v
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 9999-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "plan"

ask f: flows(konto, 9999)
=== expect
f: -100.00 PLN
  cut 9999-12-31
warning: WARN-UNREAD place other is read by nothing
